sequenceDiagram
    %% SD8 - Publish and change timetables
    %% Stories: 9, 14, 19, 49, 55, 59
    %% Description: An administrator uploads schedules, assigns them to classes and teachers and registers changes. Students view their timetable, and students and teachers are notified of changes.
    actor AP as Administrator (person)
    actor SP as Student (person)
    participant TT as Timetable
    participant ST as Student
    participant TE as Teacher

    %% covers 59
    AP->>TT: upload schedules
    %% covers 49
    AP->>TT: assign schedules to classes and teachers
    TT->>ST: student timetable
    TT->>TE: teacher timetable
    %% covers 9
    SP->>ST: view timetable
    %% covers 55
    AP->>TT: register schedule change
    %% covers 14
    TT->>ST: notify of change
    %% covers 19
    TT->>TE: notify of change
